{"seq":3,"slug":"timezone-shift","title":"跨时区班次与 follow-the-sun","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-customer-service/multilingual-routing/timezone-shift","wordCount":2807,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨时区班次与-follow-the-sun\">跨时区班次与 follow-the-sun</h1><p>一个在圣保罗、雅加达、伦敦、洛杉矶各有坐席团队的客服组织，理论上可以实现 24 小时不间断服务。实践中的失败模式是：每个团队各自排班，覆盖图看起来很漂亮，但雅加达团队下班时手上有 40 条未结会话，没有人接手，它们在夜间静静消耗 SLA 预算；而当雅加达早上回来时，这些会话已经超时。本文要解决的就是覆盖图背后的三个真问题：工作日历怎么建模、未结会话如何交接、以及各时段到底需要几个人。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-覆盖不是-有人在-而是-对的人在对的时段\">核心概念：覆盖不是「有人在，而是「对的人在对的时段」</h2><p>「24 小时覆盖」这句话本身没有信息量。有用的表述是：<strong>对每一种（语言 × 主题）技能需求，在每一个小时，都有一个达到目标服务水平的坐席容量</strong>。</p>\n<p>这个表述立刻暴露出覆盖的真正难点——它不是时间轴上的连续性问题，而是<strong>多维覆盖问题</strong>。英语可以在伦敦和洛杉矶都覆盖，但泰语只有曼谷团队能覆盖，而曼谷团队的工作时间固定，于是泰语服务天然只有 9 小时覆盖，且这 9 小时是<strong>以到达量分布的尾部为目标</strong>还是头部，需要显式决策。同理，涉及财务的争议工单需要具备「资金权限」的坐席，这个能力可能只在伦敦有。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[到达量预测&lt;br/&gt;按小时 × 语言 × 主题] --&gt; B[各时段所需坐席数&lt;br/&gt;Erlang-C 类模型]&#10;    C[团队可用性&lt;br/&gt;地点 × 语言 × 技能 × 班次] --&gt; D[覆盖矩阵]&#10;    B --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E{存在缺口?}&#10;    E --&gt;|否| F[发布班表]&#10;    E --&gt;|是| G[缺口类型判定]&#10;    G --&gt;|语言缺口| H[跨地点借调 / 招聘]&#10;    G --&gt;|时段缺口| I[调整班次起始时间&lt;br/&gt;或引入弹性班]&#10;    G --&gt;|技能缺口| J[溢出组 / 培训]&#10;    H --&gt; F&#10;    I --&gt; F&#10;    J --&gt; F\">graph TD\n    A[到达量预测&lt;br/&gt;按小时 × 语言 × 主题] --&gt; B[各时段所需坐席数&lt;br/&gt;Erlang-C 类模型]\n    C[团队可用性&lt;br/&gt;地点 × 语言 × 技能 × 班次] --&gt; D[覆盖矩阵]\n    B --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E{存在缺口?}\n    E --&gt;|否| F[发布班表]\n    E --&gt;|是| G[缺口类型判定]\n    G --&gt;|语言缺口| H[跨地点借调 / 招聘]\n    G --&gt;|时段缺口| I[调整班次起始时间&lt;br/&gt;或引入弹性班]\n    G --&gt;|技能缺口| J[溢出组 / 培训]\n    H --&gt; F\n    I --&gt; F\n    J --&gt; F</pre><p>工作单元的选择也影响覆盖：班次的最小粒度如果是 8 小时，两条班次之间就总有重叠或空隙；如果允许 4 小时弹性班（part-time shift），覆盖曲线能贴合到达量曲线，代价是排班复杂度与沟通成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工作日历-建模-什么时候算上班\">工作日历：建模「什么时候算上班」</h2><p>SLA 计时与容量规划共用同一份工作日历定义，因此它必须是一个显式的数据结构，而不是散落在代码里的判断。</p>\n<p>一条日历的核心字段是<strong>每周重复的工作时段</strong>加上<strong>例外日期</strong>（假日、临时调整）。工作日历要能表达若干种现实中存在的形状。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>日历类型</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>24x7</code></td>\n<td>全时段，无例外</td>\n<td>平台级紧急通道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>business_hours</code></td>\n<td>每工作日固定时段（如 09:00-18:00）</td>\n<td>一般咨询，按地点定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>extended_hours</code></td>\n<td>工作日时段加周末半天</td>\n<td>大促期间临时启用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>follow_the_sun</code></td>\n<td>由多地点时段拼接成的近全时段</td>\n<td>全球覆盖的合并视图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>custom</code></td>\n<td>显式列出每个时段</td>\n<td>特殊市场或法律要求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;calendar_id&quot;: &quot;BR-t1-2026&quot;,&#10;  &quot;timezone&quot;: &quot;America/Sao_Paulo&quot;,&#10;  &quot;weekly&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;dow&quot;: 1, &quot;ranges&quot;: [[&quot;09:00&quot;, &quot;18:00&quot;]] },&#10;    { &quot;dow&quot;: 2, &quot;ranges&quot;: [[&quot;09:00&quot;, &quot;18:00&quot;]] },&#10;    { &quot;dow&quot;: 3, &quot;ranges&quot;: [[&quot;09:00&quot;, &quot;18:00&quot;]] },&#10;    { &quot;dow&quot;: 4, &quot;ranges&quot;: [[&quot;09:00&quot;, &quot;18:00&quot;]] },&#10;    { &quot;dow&quot;: 5, &quot;ranges&quot;: [[&quot;09:00&quot;, &quot;17:00&quot;]] }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;exceptions&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;date&quot;: &quot;2026-09-07&quot;, &quot;ranges&quot;: [], &quot;note&quot;: &quot;Independence Day&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;date&quot;: &quot;2026-11-27&quot;, &quot;ranges&quot;: [[&quot;09:00&quot;, &quot;13:00&quot;]], &quot;note&quot;: &quot;Black Friday eve&quot; }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"calendar_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BR-t1-2026\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"timezone\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"America/Sao_Paulo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"weekly\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"dow\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ranges\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"09:00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"18:00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"dow\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ranges\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"09:00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"18:00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"dow\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ranges\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"09:00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"18:00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"dow\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ranges\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"09:00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"18:00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"dow\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ranges\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"09:00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"17:00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"exceptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-07\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ranges\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Independence Day\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-11-27\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ranges\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"09:00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"13:00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Black Friday eve\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个必须显式处理的细节。</p>\n<p><strong>细节一：<code>dow</code>（day of week）是按日历自身时区定义的。</strong> 这一点在跨时区下极易出错。一个 <code>America/Sao_Paulo</code> 的日历里 <code>dow=1</code>（周一）09:00 对应的 UTC 时刻是 12:00；若代码在 UTC 上判断 <code>dow</code>，就会把圣保罗周一的半个上午算成周日。所有日历运算必须<strong>先转换到日历时区再做日期判定</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>细节二：假日是</strong>分市场的**，必须按买家所在地或服务团队的假日算，而不是按平台总部。** 巴西的独立日与印尼的开斋节都会实质影响容量。用哪个市场的假日，取决于这条日历服务的是哪支团队——SLA 的暂停条件通常绑定「服务团队的工作日历」，因为暂停计时的含义是「此刻没有人在上班」。</p>\n<p><strong>细节三：季节性切换与夏令时。</strong> 夏令时切换会让某些本地时刻不存在或出现两次（典型是凌晨 02:00 前后一小时）。日历运算必须用带时区信息的库（IANA 时区数据库，即 tz / zoneinfo，包含全球各地本地时间历史与机器可读的 DST 规则，见 IANA Time Zone Database, <a href=\"https://www.iana.org/time-zones），绝不用固定偏移量。固定偏移在切换日会产生一小时的系统性错误，而这个错误会集中污染那一天的\">https://www.iana.org/time-zones），绝不用固定偏移量。固定偏移在切换日会产生一小时的系统性错误，而这个错误会集中污染那一天的</a> SLA 统计，导致「这几天响应怎么突然变差」的误判。</p>\n<h2 id=\"follow-the-sun-交接的是会话-不是时段\">follow-the-sun：交接的是会话，不是时段</h2><p>「跟随太阳」的字面理解是各时区团队接力，实现方式通常被描述成时间段拼接。这个描述隐藏了真正的难点：<strong>接力棒是什么，怎么交</strong>。</p>\n<p>真正需要交接的只有<strong>处于 <code>open</code> 状态且当前没有明确等待方的会话</strong>。<code>pending</code>（等买家回复）与 <code>on_hold</code>（等上游）不需要交接——它们本来就不该占用坐席的关注。</p>\n<p>交接发生在一个团队即将下班前的窗口（典型是下班前 30-60 分钟），处理方式是<strong>逐一确认归属</strong>，而不是简单地把所有未结会话的 <code>assignee</code> 批量改成接班团队。批量改的后果是责任模糊：接班团队根本不知道每条会话聊到哪了，只能从头读。</p>\n<p>一条可用的交接流程包含四个动作，每个动作都有明确的产出。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>识别候选</strong>：筛选出 <code>state = open</code> 且 <code>assignee</code> 在本团队、且最后一条消息不是买家刚发的会话。</li>\n<li><strong>要求补充交接备注</strong>：对每一条候选，要求当班坐席写一句交接说明（「已确认包裹在清关，承诺今天内给答复」）。这条备注是接班团队的唯一上下文，也是质检对象——草率的交接备注应该被反馈到培训。</li>\n<li><strong>重新路由</strong>：按技能组路由规则把这些会话派给接班团队的合适坐席。注意这里<strong>不能承接原坐席的个人归属</strong>，因为原坐席不在班。</li>\n<li><strong>写入交接记录</strong>：产生一条 <code>assignee_changed</code> 事件，<code>reason_code = shift_handoff</code>，带上交接备注。这条记录让「跨班次是否导致解决时长上升」成为可分析的指标。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE shift (&#10;  shift_id     BIGINT      PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  team_id      VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  calendar_id  VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  starts_at    DATETIME(3) NOT NULL,   -- 存 UTC&#10;  ends_at      DATETIME(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  is_on_call   TINYINT     NOT NULL,   -- 是否待命班（低配覆盖）&#10;  handoff_at   DATETIME(3) NULL        -- 交接窗口开始时刻&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE shift_handoff (&#10;  handoff_id   BIGINT      PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  shift_id     BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  case_id      BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  from_agent   BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  to_agent     BIGINT      NULL,       -- 可能暂未分派到人&#10;  note         TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  created_at   DATETIME(3) NOT NULL&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> shift</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shift_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  team_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  calendar_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  starts_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 存 UTC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ends_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  is_on_call   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TINYINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 是否待命班（低配覆盖）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  handoff_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        -- 交接窗口开始时刻</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> shift_handoff</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  handoff_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shift_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  case_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  from_agent   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  to_agent     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 可能暂未分派到人</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  note         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>一个反直觉的观察：<strong>交接成本与覆盖广度正相关</strong>。覆盖时区越多，每一条会话在一生中经历的交接次数越多（会话越长，跨越的班次边界越多），而每次交接都会引入信息损耗与延迟。因此 follow-the-sun 的收益不是无限的——它适合长解决时长的复杂案子（跨境物流争议、税务问题），对「改了地址」「查一下运单」这类分钟级会话，多团队覆盖带来的交接成本可能超过收益。判断标准是：若会话平均解决时长远大于单班次时长，follow-the-sun 值得；若远小于，把服务集中到少数几个班次、用更好的自助与机器人前置更划算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"容量-用到达率反推需要几个人\">容量：用到达率反推需要几个人</h2><p>排班的输入是<strong>预测到达量</strong>（每小时、每个语言、每个主题），输出是<strong>每时段所需坐席数</strong>。这是排队论的标准问题。</p>\n<p>关键量有三个：到达率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>（单位时间到达会话数）、平均处理时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>（单条会话占用坐席的时长），以及服务水平目标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（等待时间小于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的概率不低于某个值，如「80% 的会话在 20 秒内被接起」）。</p>\n<p>负载强度定义为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = \\frac{\\lambda}{c \\cdot \\mu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是坐席数。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 是系统稳定的必要条件：如果到达速率超过了服务速率，队列会无限增长，任何 SLA 都无法达成。这一点在坐席产能上有一个残酷推论——<strong>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho \\to 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时，等待时间趋于无穷而不是趋于某个有限值</strong>。所以扩容不能依赖「把现有坐席压榨得更紧」，「接近满载」在排队系统里等于「必然崩」。</p>\n<p>Erlang-C 公式给出等待概率的解析近似：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_w = \\frac{\\frac{a^c}{c!}\\cdot\\frac{c}{c-a}}{\\sum_{k=0}^{c-1}\\frac{a^k}{k!} + \\frac{a^c}{c!}\\cdot\\frac{c}{c-a}}, \\qquad a = \\lambda / \\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9516em;vertical-align:-1.2473em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.156em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9414em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">!</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.782em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8095em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">!</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5935em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6954em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7933em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">!</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7385em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6954em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2473em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 是「提供负载」（offered load，单位 erlang）。它给出一个可以反解的方程：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 与目标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，求最小的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>。（Erlang-C 的标准形式以 offered load <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E=\\lambda h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λh</span></span></span></span></span> 与服务器数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 表示，假定泊松到达、指数服务时长、无限队列且顾客不放弃；该式用于反解客服中心所需坐席数，见 Erlang (unit) / Erlang C, Wikipedia, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Erlang_(unit)）\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Erlang_(unit)）</a></p>\n<p>工程上不需要每次求解析解，做法是<strong>建表 + 查表 + 加余量</strong>：预先算好不同 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 组合下的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，排班时查表，然后叠加三类余量——病假与临时请假（通常 10-15%）、大促的预测误差（采用保守分位数而非均值）、以及突发峰值的缓冲（待命班）。这个模型族假设到达近似泊松过程，在大多数客服场景下成立，但<strong>在大促瞬间失效</strong>（到达是脉冲式的），所以大促必须叠加事件驱动的扩容而不是只靠排队论。</p>\n<p>反解得到的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 还需要按<strong>技能组分别求</strong>，不能对总量求。因为技能组之间不可互换——算出全站需要 40 人，不代表葡语物流组需要的人够。人力不足时正确的降级顺序是：先在组内增加弹性班，再把低优先级主题的会话阈值放宽（延长目标时长），最后才考虑跨技能借调（需要培训成本）。</p>\n<p>在线监控上，最该盯的指标不是「当前排队数」，而是<strong>排队数的一阶导数与预测到达量的偏离</strong>。排队数突然开始上升而预测没有变化，通常是某类会话的到达结构变了（比如某个市场发布了一次物流延迟公告），需要立即介入，而不是等它涨到阈值才报警。这类实时容量告警属于 <a href=\"../sla-quality/service-observability\">客服量/响应/解决监控与大促扩容</a> 的职责范围。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>覆盖的正确表述是「<strong>每个时段、每个（语言 × 主题）技能组合都有达标的坐席容量</strong>」，而不是「24 小时有人」；覆盖是多维问题，缺口要分层定位到语言、时段或技能。</li>\n<li>工作日历必须是显式数据结构（每周时段 + 例外日期），且 <code>dow</code> 判定必须在<strong>日历自身时区</strong>进行；假日按服务团队所在市场取；夏令时用 IANA 时区库而非固定偏移。</li>\n<li>follow-the-sun 交接的对象只有 <code>open</code> 的会话，交接必须要求当班坐席写备注并记录为 <code>shift_handoff</code> 事件；交接成本随时区数上升，只有长解决时长的会话才值得。</li>\n<li>容量用 Erlang-C 反解 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho \\to 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时等待时间发散，因此「接近满载」不是效率而是风险；余量要按病假、预测误差、突发峰值三类分开估算。</li>\n<li>大促是脉冲式到达，排队论近似失效，必须叠加事件驱动的扩容；扩容的实时信号是排队数增速与预测的偏离，见 <a href=\"../sla-quality/service-observability\">客服量/响应/解决监控与大促扩容</a>。</li>\n<li>排班产出的「有效工作时段」正是 <a href=\"../sla-quality/sla-timezone-calc\">跨时区 SLA 计时与超时升级</a> 用来折算目标时长的输入。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跨时区班次与 follow-the-sun","id":"跨时区班次与-follow-the-sun"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：覆盖不是「有人在，而是「对的人在对的时段」","id":"核心概念-覆盖不是-有人在-而是-对的人在对的时段"},{"level":2,"text":"工作日历：建模「什么时候算上班」","id":"工作日历-建模-什么时候算上班"},{"level":2,"text":"follow-the-sun：交接的是会话，不是时段","id":"follow-the-sun-交接的是会话-不是时段"},{"level":2,"text":"容量：用到达率反推需要几个人","id":"容量-用到达率反推需要几个人"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"机器翻译辅助坐席（非自动回复）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-customer-service/multilingual-routing/mt-assist-agent"},"next":{"title":"意图识别机器人与转人工时机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-customer-service/bot-triage/intent-bot-handoff"}}